Your job is to go in and add a contents card for one app here to this Go CLI/TUI app.

Cream paper, a serif title, a stamp with the app's initials, then the facts: host, image or folder, uptime, last deploy, last backup. It is the card the rest of the interface is built around, so make it good.

Done is when make test runs clean and so do house-style lints

